: 5pt; word-break: keep-all;\"><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 14pt;\">&nbsp; 나</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">. </span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 14pt;\">추천권자</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">: </span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 14pt;\">학부모</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 14pt;\">대학</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">(</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 14pt;\">원</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">)</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 14pt;\">생 등</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-right: 5pt; word-break: keep-all;\"><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 14pt;\">&nbsp; 다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">. </span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 14pt;\">대 상 자</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">: </span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 14pt;\">본교에 재직하고 있는 현직 교원</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-right: 5pt; word-break: keep-all;\"><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 14pt;\">&nbsp; 라</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">. </span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 14pt;\">추천분야</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">:</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-right: 5pt; word-break: keep-all; font-size: 12pt;\"></p><table style=\"border-width: initial; border-style: none; border-color: initial;\"><tbody><tr><td style=\"width: 52.77pt; height: 25px; padding: 1.41pt 5.1p